---
description: Rules for adding or changing status summary fields
globs: src/status_bridge/models.py,src/status_bridge/service.py,src/status_bridge/cli.py,tests/test_service.py,tests/test_api_incidents.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- read AGENTS.md and docs/architecture.md before editing a summary field
- keep the field derived from open incidents unless the task says otherwise
- update the summary model, the service, the CLI output, and a focused test together
- keep the diff limited to those files unless a real defect forces another edit
- run uv run pytest tests/test_service.py and then uv run pytest
